			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 10, DX 14, IQ 3, HT 10, HP 10, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 10, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
