			"id": "nNoDkFsnxUPmhQvi7",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 22 (offense 22, protection 0), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nRVBEa7y9XW3u-eg0",
			"text": "Feeding Frenzy: No attack roll and no active defense. Feeding Frenzy: 1d+1 cutting, Reach C. No attack roll and no defense. Everything in the water in that hex is being bitten continuously, and blood in the water makes it worse rather than better."
		},
